# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Data law (CLAUDE.md) enforced at the git boundary.
# Default-deny on content/, build/, tools/ — named whitelists only.
# Pushing is publishing: local-only material NEVER ships, even to a
# private remote (purchased PDFs, official extractions, PST voice rips,
# dabus renders, the D&D Beyond inbox).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Python / tooling cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.log
Thumbs.db
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── D&D Beyond browser-save inbox: user-purchased, local-only ───────────
D&D Beyond/

# ── content/ corpus (5.2G): freely OBTAINED ≠ freely REDISTRIBUTABLE ────
# content/official/ is purchased PDFs — never redistributed, full stop.
# The rest (SRDs, retroclones, fan archives, wiki exports) is re-gatherable
# via the _meta scripts. Only the provenance charter, the inventory, and
# the hand-written gather tooling are versioned.
content/**
!content/README.md
!content/INDEX.md
!content/_meta/
!content/_meta/**
content/_meta/tmp/
content/_meta/*.json

# ── build/ (267M): derived — pipelines rebuild it from content/ ─────────
# Per-book extraction trees hold the FULL TEXT + images of purchased
# official PDFs (book.md, reflow/page-*.txt, images/) — local-only.
# Whitelisted: hand-authored records that survive every rebuild.
build/**
!build/**/
!build/mimir/curations.json
!build/family/*.md
!build/mechanus/vnv-report.md
!build/mechanus/conversion-prior-art.md
!build/modron/vnv/*.json
!build/encounters/**

# ── tools/ (6.3G): voice stack — venv, models, clones, rips stay local ──
# f5-venv (interpreter), F5-TTS (nested clone; patch map lives in README),
# minilm (ONNX), sounds-* (PST rips — living actors, local-only lane law),
# _renders/. Whitelisted: the venv/patch map, onboarding scripts, and the
# hand-tuned voice-pack + cast TOMLs.
tools/**
!tools/README.md
!tools/*.py
!tools/voices/
!tools/voices/*.toml
!tools/voices/README.md
